| `LessonProgress.percentage/isDone` | DERIVED METRIC |
| `StepProgress.progress/isDone` | DERIVED METRIC |
| `SubTopicProgress.progress/completed` | DERIVED METRIC |
| `UserTopic.progressPercent` | DERIVED METRIC |
